<view class="page page-narrow budget-page">
  <view class="page-header"><view><view class="eyebrow">装修准备</view><view class="title title-lg">装修预算估算</view><view class="muted">这是用于前期规划的区间参考，不构成商家报价或施工承诺。面积、户型、拆改和设备选择都会影响最终费用。</view></view></view>
  <view class="section form"><view class="field"><view class="label">套内面积（平方米）</view><input type="digit" placeholder="例如 89" value="{{area}}" bindinput="onAreaInput" /></view><view class="field"><view class="label">装修标准</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{levels}}" range-key="label" value="{{levelIndex}}" bindchange="onLevelChange"><view class="picker">{{levels[levelIndex].label}}</view></picker><view class="helper">{{levels[levelIndex].note}}</view></view><button class="button-primary" bindtap="calculate">生成预算区间</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{result}}" class="result-card"><view class="eyebrow">初步预算</view><view class="result-total">{{result.low}} - {{result.high}} 元</view><view class="muted">已包含约 8% 的不可预见费：{{result.reserveLow}} - {{result.reserveHigh}} 元。</view><view class="result-lines"><view><text>基础施工与主材</text><text>{{result.level.label}}</text></view><view><text>建议下一步</text><text>先确认户型与功能需求</text></view></view><button class="button-secondary" bindtap="openRequest">带着需求提交装修咨询</button></view>
</view>
